KPL/IK

Hayabusa2 ONC Instrument kernel
==============================================================================

   This instrument kernel (I-kernel) file contains detector, optical, and
   field-of-view parameters for the Hayabusa2 Optical Navigation Camera (ONC)
   instrument.


